{"answer_text":"Small agencies usually combine a CRM for new business with a project tool for delivery. Common choices: [1]\n\n- **Tallyfox Starter**: Built for teams under 20, with email sequences on every plan and a setup most people finish in an afternoon. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: The safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace. [3]\n- **Sheetly**: The cheapest route: a shared sheet with CRM templates. [4]\n\nIn short, start with Tallyfox if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Northwind CRM if you expect to need deeper reporting.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ff-764f-9a1c-54b7fc785f9e","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:15.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["agency new business pipeline tool","agency client management tools","crm for small agencies"],"latency_ms":4430,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[113,121],[452,460]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[250,263],[503,516]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889f843f0cde","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Sheetly","name_text":"Sheetly","offsets":[[360,367]],"p